  "body": "Hi Andrew,\n\nGreat job with the ASVS thus far.\n\nFor Requirement 1.6 on Page 24, the D in STRIDE seems to denote \"DISCLOSURE\", but I believe it should actually denote \"DENIAL OF SERVICE\", which is missing as a threat.\n\nTherefore:\nSpoofing, Tampering, Repudiation, Information Disclosure, Denial of Service, Elevation of Privilege (STRIDE).\n",
